    </div>

    <!-- Toolbar: Technical Tabs -->
    <div class="bb__toolbar" data-bb-tabs>
      <button type="button" class="bb__tab is-active" data-target="proto">[ 01: PD 3.1 &amp; GAN PROTOCOL ]</button>
      <button type="button" class="bb__tab" data-target="thermal">[ 02: SILENT THERMAL MATRIX ]</button>
      <button type="button" class="bb__tab" data-target="milspec">[ 03: MIL-STD-810H ARMOR ]</button>
      <button type="button" class="bb__tab" data-target="warranty">[ 04: 2-YEAR VIP REPLACEMENT ]</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab Panel -->
    <div class="bb__tab-panel">
      <!-- Content 1: Proto -->
      <div class="bb__content is-active" data-content="proto">
        <h3 class="bb__content-title">[ GALLIUM NITRIDE (GAN) GEN 4 ARCHITECTURE ]</h3>
        <p class="bb__content-desc">
          Using cheap silicone adapters causes voltage spikes that degrade lithium-ion battery health within 6 months. Our GaN Gen 4 chargers deliver clean 140W power delivery with micro-processor temperature sampling 500 times per second.
        </p>
        <div class="bb__grid">
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">VOLTAGE RIPPLE:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">&lt; 10MV &bull; ULTRA CLEAN DC POWER</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">EFFICIENCY RATING:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">95.4% AC TO DC CONVERSION</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">THERMAL CUTOFF:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">AUTOMATIC 75&deg;C SAFETY SHUTDOWN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">PROTOCOL COMPLIANCE:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">USB-IF PD 3.1 / PPS / QC 5.0</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content 2: Thermal -->
      <div class="bb__content" data-content="thermal">
        <h3 class="bb__content-title">[ VAPOR CHAMBER COOLING DYNAMICS ]</h3>
        <p class="bb__content-desc">
          High-performance silicon requires rapid heat dissipation to maintain peak boost clocks during sustained rendering or compiling workloads. Our hardware rigs integrate custom graphite thermal pads and vapor chambers.
        </p>
        <div class="bb__grid">
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">THERMAL CONDUCTIVITY:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">1500 W/M&middot;K GRAPHITE MATRIX</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">FAN ACOUSTICS:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">0 DB SILENT IDLE &bull; &lt; 24 DB MAX LOAD</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">THROTTLING INCIDENCE:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">0.0% UNDER 100% EXTREME TORTURE TEST</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">OPERATING TEMP:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">-10&deg;C TO 45&deg;C AMBIENT RATED</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content 3: Milspec -->
      <div class="bb__content" data-content="milspec">
        <h3 class="bb__content-title">[ BALLISTIC PROTECTION &amp; RFID SHIELDING ]</h3>
        <p class="bb__content-desc">
          We protect your workstation equipment with genuine 1680D Ballistic Nylon originally developed for military body armor. Integrated copper-nickel mesh layers completely block unauthorized RFID and NFC scanning.
        </p>
        <div class="bb__grid">
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">ABRASION RESISTANCE:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">100,000 MARTINDALE RUB TESTED</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">WATER REPELLENCY:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">DWR COATED &bull; IPX4 WEATHERPROOF</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">DROP PROTECTION:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">1.8 METERS ONTO CONCRETE RATED</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">RFID ATTENUATION:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">99.9% SIGNAL BLOCKING AT 13.56MHZ</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content 4: Warranty -->
      <div class="bb__content" data-content="warranty">
        <h3 class="bb__content-title">[ 2-YEAR VIP ADVANCED REPLACEMENT CARE ]</h3>
        <p class="bb__content-desc">
          When you unlock Tier 3 (4 items selected), your entire ecosystem rig is automatically enrolled in our VIP Concierge Care program. If any component suffers accidental damage or electrical failure, we ship a brand new replacement overnight before you return the old unit.
        </p>
        <div class="bb__grid">
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">REPLACEMENT SPEED:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">OVERNIGHT AIR DISPATCH</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">DEDUCTIBLE / FEE:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">RS. 0 &bull; 100% COMPLIMENTARY</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">COVERAGE DURATION:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">24 MONTHS FROM DELIVERY DATE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bb__grid-item">
            <span class="bb__grid-lbl">ACCIDENTAL DAMAGE:</span>
            <span class="bb__grid-val">2 INCIDENTS INCLUDED PER YEAR</span>
          </div>
